## X-ZacUI-Part: Meter

# Part of ZacUI. These files were lifted out of the main addon so this
# piece can be switched off in the AddOns list on its own. They share
# ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by Core_Boot) and its saved
# variables; every setting still lives in ZacUIDB and in profiles.
# Load order within this file is the same as it was inside ZacUI.

Data\Meter_Data.lua
Engine\Meter_Combat.lua
Engine\Meter_Parser.lua
Engine\Meter_GameMeter.lua
Windows\Meter_Windows.lua
Windows\Meter_Win_Menus.lua
Windows\Meter_Win_Frame.lua
Threat\Meter_Threat.lua
Threat\Meter_ThreatGlow.lua
Windows\Meter_Info.lua
Windows\Meter_Win_Breakdown.lua
Windows\Meter_Win_Live.lua
Summary\Meter_RaidSummary.lua

# This part's settings pages load on demand with ZacUI's settings window:
# the Zacui_Options addon, Meter folder (2026-11-13).
